ek. Enjoy!HUD OptionsYou asked, we listened. We’ve now implemented a HUD options menu, with toggles for various HUD features (fixed, follow), category of info and style variations.We’re not done yet, we plan to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:13:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036346","verified_at":"2026-10-23T13:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1846651706682668","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 12: The Demo is Live!","summary":"Hello DRIFTERS,Our Demo is finally live! You can jump in right now and experience what we've been building for the last two years. Here's also a video on what we've recently added to the game:We've been hard at work improving performance, stability, and the overall gameplay experience in DRIFTERS! This update brings a many optimizations, multiplayer fixes, and gameplay improvements, along with a new ultimate. HighlightsMajor performance improvements! We've optimized everything from enemy animati","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:10:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1844751498224681","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 10: The Future of DRIFTERS","summary":"Hello everyone, a new DRIFTERS devlog is live!This time we’re talking about the immediate future of DRIFTERS and what we are planning based on the playtests feedbackWatch it here:Let us know what you think and what you’d like to see more of!Wishlist DRIFTERS now! Join our Discord to get playtests access! https://discord.gg/salmigames","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T14:06:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1843481262698232","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest this Weekend","summary":"We're excited to run our first playtest on SteamVR. PLAYTEST DETAILSSign up and receive your key through our Discord - https://discord.gg/bgq3u9TgpjThis playtest session is running NOW until Monday 9AM CET (Sunday midnight PST)We would love to have as much feedback as possible and continue building this game with the community - we've received ´many valuable insights already and the game is looking better each day. We hope to see you out there, DRIFTERS!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T20:14:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1840944183775007","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 6: Wrist Guns Baby!","summary":"Hello DRIFTERS,A new DevLog focused on the Wrist Gun - come explore our inspirations and the different tools and weapons we packed into it.Wrist GunVR Games Showcase - A Deeper DiveYou should stay tuned to tomorrow’s VR Games Showcase for a DRIFTERS special! We worked with their team to put together a really cool, more in-depth look at the game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T20:53:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775007","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1839041357030548","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 4: Movement Systems and Jetpack","summary":"Hello everyone, a new DRIFTERS devlog is live!This time we’re taking a look at our movement systems, introducing our jetpack abilities, and giving a first look at one of our levels.We’re focused on creating fun ways to move through the environment, and we’ll keep building on these systems as development continues.Watch it here:Let us know what you think and what you’d like to see more of!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T19:33:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1838407329259573","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 3: Sweet Surrender Sales and Company Updates","summary":"Hello everyone, today we are answering viewers’ questions about:How we supported Sweet Surrender for so longOur team structureSales numbers!And sharing updates on the Development of DRIFTERS.Watch it here:Let us know what you think and what you’d like to see more of!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T13:52:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1836506165584488","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 2: Weapon Crafting and a bit more Sniper","summary":"Hello everyone, a new DRIFTERS devlog is live!This time we’re taking a look at the weapon crafting system and a few first add-ons and modifiers for weapons.Watch it here:Let us know what you think and what you’d like to see more of!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T20:11:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165584488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4701660-1836506165570571","game_id":"steam-4701660","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog 1: Wishlist Numbers & Weapon Intro!","summary":"Our first DRIFTERS devlog is live.We’re showing a bit of the current weapon handling, talking about our plans for the game, and sharing a quick wishlist update after the reveal.A lot is still work in progress, but we want to start bringing you along more regularly as development continues.Watch it here: We’d love to hear what you think and what you’d like to see covered in future devlogs.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T13:53:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570571","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4701660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4701660":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4701660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z"},"5284020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:39Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4701660","app_id":4701660,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana